# Polar

> Payments & Billing with 6 lines of code. Open Source & Global Merchant of Record.

## Documentation

### Get Started

- [Polar: Turn Your Software into a Business](https://polar.sh/docs/introduction.md): The next generation unicorns will be built by smaller teams. Polar makes that dream possible.
- [Merchant of Record](https://polar.sh/docs/merchant-of-record/introduction.md): An open source and transparent Merchant of Record
- [Polar Pricing](https://polar.sh/docs/merchant-of-record/fees.md): Transparent, public pricing — pick the plan that fits

#### Migrating to Polar

- [Migrate from Stripe](https://polar.sh/docs/migrate.md): Move customers, products, subscriptions, and payment data from Stripe to Polar.
- [Migrate from Lemon Squeezy](https://polar.sh/docs/migrate-lemon-squeezy.md): What moving from Lemon Squeezy to Polar looks like today, and what we're still working on.

### Agent Toolkit

- [Model Context Protocol (MCP)](https://polar.sh/docs/integrate/mcp.md): Connect AI agents to Polar to manage products, customers, subscriptions, orders, and more.

#### CLI

- [Polar CLI](https://polar.sh/docs/integrate/cli/introduction.md): Forward webhooks to your machine, trigger sample events and manage your Polar sessions from the terminal
- [Authentication](https://polar.sh/docs/integrate/cli/authentication.md): Sign in to Polar from the CLI and choose the organization you work on
- [Webhooks on your machine](https://polar.sh/docs/integrate/cli/webhooks.md): Receive real webhook events locally and trigger sample events on demand
- [Command reference](https://polar.sh/docs/integrate/cli/reference.md): Every command, argument and flag of the Polar CLI

##### CLI commands

- [polar auth](https://polar.sh/docs/integrate/cli/reference/auth.md): Manage your Polar sessions and active organization
- [polar agent](https://polar.sh/docs/integrate/cli/reference/agent.md): Set up coding agents to build with Polar
- [polar webhook](https://polar.sh/docs/integrate/cli/reference/webhook.md): Test webhooks against your local server
- [polar update](https://polar.sh/docs/integrate/cli/reference/update.md): Update the CLI to the latest release

